9:### gen-mapping -> `mapping.json`
10-```json
11-{"request_id": "gen-...", "mapping": {
12-  "revenue": {"concept": "Revenues", "rationale": "Total revenue on the income statement; 16 quarters through the latest period."},
13-  "short_term_investments": {"concept": null, "rationale": "Not reported separately after FY2026 Q3; see narrative."}
14-}}
15-```
16-Lines are those in `references/xbrl_catalog.yaml`. `concept` may be any us-gaap concept
17-that has data in the snapshot, or a **list of concepts that are summed per period** (for a line
18-the company reports in parts, e.g. `["DebtSecuritiesCurrent", "EquitySecuritiesFvNi"]`);
19-`null` means deliberately unmapped (explain why). Use `eu.py concepts --search` to find
20-concepts outside the catalog.
